RQ164 — Human Agency Versus AI Agency

Research Question

How do students distinguish human agency from AI agency?

Short Title

Human and Machine Agency

Purpose

This question examines whether students can identify the difference between:

* a person making a decision;
* a person delegating a decision;
* an AI recommending an action;
* an AI executing an action;
* and an institution authorizing an AI system.

Candidate Learning Outcomes

Students should be able to identify:

* who initiated an action;
* who authorized it;
* who can stop it;
* who is accountable;
* and what technical system executed it.

